  "body_html": "<h1>Brouwer Fixed Point Theorem</h1>\n<p>Let $C$ be a nonempty convex compact subset of a finite-dimensional Euclidean\nspace. Every continuous function\n$$\n  f:C\\to C\n$$\nhas a fixed point.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Thm. 4.11.4] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>, <code>references/MathFoundationsGameTheory.pdf</code>. Brouwer fixed point theorem for compact convex subsets of finite-dimensional Euclidean space.</li>\n</ul>",
